	abstract = {This document describes classes and methods designed to deal with different types of ifgi Einsatzbereiche: Briefbogen, Visitenkarte, Titelblätter etc. spatio-temporal data in R implemented in the R package spacetime, and provides exam- Institut für Geoinformatik Mindestgröße 45 mm Breite Universität Münster ples for analyzing them. It builds upon the classes and methods for spatial data from package sp, and for time series data from package xts. The goal is to cover a number of useful representations for spatio-temporal sensor data, and results from predicting (spa- tial and/or temporal interpolation or smoothing), aggregating, or subsetting them, and to represent trajectories. The goals of this paper is to explore how spatio-temporal data can be sensibly represented in classes, and to find out which analysis and visualisation Dieses Logo kann bei Anwendungen methods are useful and feasible. We discuss the convention of representing time intervals eingesetzt werden, wo das Logo besonders klein erscheint. by the starting time instance. This document is the main reference for the R package Einsatzbereiche: Sponsorenlogo, spacetime, and is available (in updated form) as a vignette in this package.},
